evidence: Usage-matched connector vs role occupant identity break is large and significant (n=96). Licensed comparison excludes organizers.\n- observed_sample_and_power: n=96 matched pairs vs role; n=25 vs terminal; 908 player-seasons\n- auto_related_family: FAM:SF-PAP-028"}, {"id": "FAM:SF-APPS-036", "score": 0.098, "document": "# FAM:SF-APPS-036 | Study family SF-APPS-036: Player-level BEST vs AVOID PPP gap (initiators, 55-series)\n- observed_research_question: Player-level BEST vs AVOID PPP gap (initiators, 55-series)\n- auto_outcome_status: supported\n- observed_hypothesis: The team-level BEST vs AVOID gap holds when H2 possessions are filtered to initiating player.\n- observed_result: Mean gap (n>=10 each tier) +0.427 PPP. Mean BEST 1.347 (38 players) vs AVOID 0.920 (94 players). Stars mean gap +0.542 (n=15) vs role +0.428 (n=16). Only 3 players clear n>=30 both tiers (all BOS: White +0.864, Brown +0. [cut; read_family for the full text]\n- auto_failure_mechanism: D_positive (no failure: positive result)\n- auto_limited_by: LIM:small_sample\n- auto_has_risk: RISK:SAMPLE_SIZE_POWER\n- observed_failure_evidence: Pooled player gap +0.427 in the same direction as the team gap; most star cells are below the n>=30 gate.\n- observed_sample_and_power: 38/94 players at n>=15; only 3 at n>=30 both tiers\n- auto_validation_status: no_validation_recorded; evidence: NOT_RECORDED"}, {"id": "FAM:SF-APPS-087", "score": 0.096, "document": "# FAM:SF-APPS-087 | Study family SF-APPS-087: Connector tangible impact: star shielding, TO, lineup lift\n- observed_research_question: Connector tangible impact: star shielding, TO, lineup lift\n- auto_outcome_status: rejected\n- observed_hypothesis: Connector presence shields stars (higher TS, lower TO) and lifts lineup ORtg beyond talent.\n- observed_result: Star dTS +0.05 pp p=0.937; dTO +0.74 pp p=0.00364 (wrong sign for shielding). Star-init TO~HasConn beta=+0.34 pp p=0.439. HasConn on-off PPP BOTH_NULL (mean -0.041 p=0.939, median +0.528 p=0.731, n=73). Frequent-conn lin [cut; read_family for the full text]\n- auto_failure_mechanism: B_powered_null (adequately powered null result)\n- auto_limited_by: LIM:confounding\n- auto_limited_by: LIM:small_sample\n- auto_has_risk: RISK:CONFOUNDING\n- auto_has_risk: RISK:SAMPLE_SIZE_POWER\n- observed_failure_evidence: PPP/TS/eFG shielding null; TO rate rises with connectors. Lineup ORtg lift is a talent confound (p=0.51 after TALENT; swap p=0.565).\n- auto_related_family: FAM:SF-APPS-086\n- observed_verdict: null"}], "n_results": 4}

