        "text": "The number of players who are identifiable as 'cut-heavy' or 'drive-heavy shapers' and who also change teams/roles within the 4 seasons of data is likely very small, making a statistically powerful comparison challenging. Prior work consistently shows small sample issues for player-specific analyses."
