      "text": "Operationalizing 'cut-heavy' and 'drive-heavy' shapers requires clear, reliable definitions from play-by-play data. Similarly, quantifying 'role travel' (e.g., consistency of impact, efficiency, or usage) needs robust and validated metrics that capture the essence of 'traveling better'."
